  "worked_solution": "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(4\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot (-5))i-(3\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 2)j+(3\\cdot (-5)-4\\cdot 2)k \\\\  & =(8-5)i-(6+2)j+(-15-8)k \\\\  & =3i-8j-23k \\\\  & =\u27e83,-8,-23\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
